WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:36.460
I thought I defeated Bakura, but time rewound.

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:41.220
My Millennium Puzzle was taken, and I fell to the bottom of the canyon.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:46.670
While unconscious, I dreamed of my Father.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:50.650
When I woke up, I saw someone named Hasan.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:56.090
Zorc is my real enemy?

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:02.090
Ghost Village

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:32.900
Seems you knew I'd come.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.400
But I have no business with you.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:40.410
I have business with what's inside.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.230
Unfortunately, what you seek isn't in there.

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.400
What?

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.380
The stone tablet in this museum is a replica.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.270
The real one has been returned to its proper location.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.190
Where?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:59.120
What will you do if I tell you?

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:02.720
That’s...

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:04.650
The Millennium Eye!

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:10.670
Bakura challenged me by giving me this, and I’ve come to accept.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.060
Bakura?

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:16.610
Other than us, only he knows the Millennium Items' secrets.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:20.780
I see!  He's also...

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.680
Sister!

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:26.800
Seto, go to the tablet.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.340
And you will learn the truth.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.880
Wow!

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.660
What are they doing?

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.990
Don't they realize these are tough times?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.920
My other self...

00:03:59.310 --> 00:04:01.850
Bakura stole your Millennium Puzzle?

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:02.770
Yeah.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.370
But I will get it back.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.980
It’s a precious item my Father gave me.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:10.660
Your Father?

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.300
You regained your memories?

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:16.670
Only a little.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.360
It may have been a dream.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:24.960
But I remember how warm my father’s hands were.

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:35.030
He created the Millennium Items to protect this kingdom and maintain peace.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:39.070
Your father created the Millennium Items?

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:45.070
Yes.  That's why I can't let Bakura use them for his plans.

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:47.000
My other self...

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.670
What about your name?

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.050
Well...

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.210
You still don’t know your name.

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.920
No one here calls me by my name.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:02.210
And no one will tell me.

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.790
Prince, swim with us!

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.620
Swim!

00:05:15.930 --> 00:05:18.870
The white dragon lives inside Kisara.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.530
That Ka is like no other.

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:41.210
The white dragon is a Ba.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.320
Seto, steal her Ka!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.880
Kill her and take her white dragon!

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.700
God will be yours!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:56.700
Aknadin taught us priests to show mercy to criminals.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:09.380
When I was still a newcomer, you were the one who taught me everything.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.550
So why are you acting like this?

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.850
Seto!

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.710
We found the Pharaoh!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:19.330
What?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:20.450
The Pharaoh?

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.990
Move her to a different room.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.710
Make sure no one sees you!

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:35.000
Isis’s Spiria found the Pharaoh.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.800
The Pharaoh is safe!

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:44.080
I saw Shada nearby, so I ordered him to go to the Pharaoh.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.820
I feel relieved.

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.670
The Pharaoh is alive.

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:58.830
But...

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:05.550
Bakura may have taken the Pharaoh’s Millennium Puzzle.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:12.840
Bobasa?

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:15.850
So you’re the Pharaoh.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:17.290
And you are?

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:19.230
I’m happy to meet you!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.320
He’s Bobasa.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:25.230
Like us, no one in this world can see him.

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:28.020
We don’t know anything about him, except his name.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:29.500
But he's a friend.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.450
Yes.  Bobasa is a friend.

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.600
I see.  Nice to meet you.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:39.340
The Pharaoh is also my friend.

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.570
Pharaoh!

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.460
Pharaoh, you’re safe.

00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:55.300
Yes.  Sorry to worry you.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.200
He can’t see me.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:07:57.890
Hey!

00:07:58.390 --> 00:07:59.950
Where are you going, Mana?

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:01.390
Gulp!

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.840
Umm...

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:06.700
Why didn't you tell us that you found the Pharaoh?

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:07.760
I’m sorry!

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.980
He's scary.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:14.370
Pharaoh, we found Bakura’s location.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:15.590
What?

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:21.690
My soldiers followed his trail to Kul Elna Village.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.810
We’re going to Kul Elna Village!

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.320
Wait up!  We’re going too!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:31.920
This is Bakura's Shadow Game.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:35.490
This world's Bakura isn't the Bakura you know.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.940
He’s dangerous.  I don't know what he'll do.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:41.930
I don’t want to drag you into this.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:44.330
I'll end things with Bakura!

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.230
Go back home to your world.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:50.250
I was happy to see you all.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.150
My other self!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:55.160
I’m going too!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.960
Yugi was kinda cold with us.

00:08:57.960 --> 00:09:02.650
Well, we are ghosts in this world.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:04.370
We can't help him.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:05.620
But...

00:09:08.140 --> 00:09:11.990
There must be something we can do!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.640
You're right, Yugi!

00:09:13.640 --> 00:09:16.100
It’s too early to give up!

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.300
That’s true.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:19.940
It's true that I’m hungry!

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:24.690
Bakura is at Kul Elna Village?

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:28.220
Yes.  The Pharaoh and Shada are heading there.

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.290
Priests, you go too!

00:09:34.230 --> 00:09:37.150
Kul... Elna Village?

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.900
This is Kul Elna Village?

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:04.290
This place is eerie.

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:15.690
Ever since entering this village, I feel like it’s harder to breathe.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.130
What happened here?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.130
There’s someone here...

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.360
Monsters!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:40.790
What is this?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:50.410
The Millennium Ring is reacting to something.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:53.610
I knew you were alive, Pharaoh.

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:57.200
Welcome to my hometown.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.110
This is my field.

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:26.160
Pharaoh!

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.640
Master...

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.470
Don’t back down!

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:32.780
Protect the Pharaoh!

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:34.540
Mana.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.760
Help the Pharaoh.

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:40.880
Please go, Prince!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.120
I've trained too!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.190
I know how to fight!

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:48.470
But...

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.120
Hurry!

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:53.290
My Master would fight if he was here, so I’m fighting too!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:55.040
Trust me!

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:55.720
Mana...

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.230
I summon Two-Headed Jackal Warrior!

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:10.910
We'll hold them back!  Hurry!

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.910
I’m counting on you, Mana and Shada!

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:23.830
The spirits are restless.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:27.260
They know that their hated Pharaoh is coming.

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:31.670
You'll be able to get your revenge soon.

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:50.540
You’ve come, Pharaoh!

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:56.420
The Millennium Puzzle I took from you is hanging from my neck!

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.580
Mana!

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.720
Mana, you can do that?

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:24.380
Welcome back from the edge of death, Pharaoh.

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.310
Bakura!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.320
Calm down and look at this.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:36.360
The seven Millennium Items fit in those indentations.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:39.060
Is that the tablet to the afterlife?

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:43.310
This cursed tablet links this world with the next.

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:49.750
The cursed spirits who died with hate in their hearts wander here to this day.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:56.680
Because villagers and soldiers were sacrificed to create the Millennium Items.

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.610
Sacrificed?

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:05.060
I know you can see the spirits who want revenge on the royal family.

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:10.020
But my father Aknamkanon created the Millennium Items for peace.

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.220
Is this true?

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:15.120
Without the Millennium Puzzle, the Pharaoh can’t summon the gods!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.910
Spirits!  Tear him to pieces!

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:34.000
Can't you hear them yearn for revenge?

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:38.420
Father, tell me the truth about the Millennium Items.

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:42.370
Pay for your father’s crime with your life.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.420
What's this?

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.520
My soul is with the Pharaoh!

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:08.150
Mahad!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.880
You again?

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:14.100
Couldn’t move on because you're worried about this worthless Pharaoh?

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.390
Please stand, Pharaoh.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.070
Is it really you, Mahad?

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:23.060
My will is the same as yours.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:27.010
So if you lose the will to fight, I will also vanish.

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:28.470
Will to fight...

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:34.670
I believed the Millennium Items were to be used for justice.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:37.690
Justice?  What a joke!

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:40.550
Your father is a villain!

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:45.320
I saw the whole tragedy from beginning to end.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:51.560
As the sole survivor of this village, I'm telling the truth.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:57.100
Everyone was killed in order to make the Millennium Items.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:01.830
My father committed such cruelty?

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:06.870
It’s true that many were sacrificed to create the Millennium Items.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.770
You knew?

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:12.600
I sensed the evil within the Millennium Ring.

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:16.230
And learned how the Millennium Items were created.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.220
It was a disgusting incident.

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:24.760
But Aknamkanon didn't know the true story.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.330
What?  Is that what happened?

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:29.930
How horrible.

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:38.160
I made a mistake.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:42.750
But I do not want to burden my son with my mistake.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:46.150
Please, Mahad.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:49.810
Protect my son.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.060
Father!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:57.320
The former Pharaoh truly wished for peace.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:00.790
And that wish has been passed down to you, Pharaoh!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.360
To me...

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.400
Enough with the nonsense!

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.230
Go, spirits!

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.840
Annihilate the Pharaoh and the spellcaster!

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:15.080
I’ve committed an unforgivable sin.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:21.750
It's my fault for creating the seven Millennium Items.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:24.280
My father was in anguish!

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:30.260
But he still taught me to love and rule this kingdom!

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.890
I believe in my father!

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:39.300
And I'll fight as the Pharaoh to continue his legacy!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.490
So you regained some of your memories.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:49.060
Well, I never actually cared about these spirits' desire for revenge.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.740
I’ll show you my Ka!

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.180
Here it comes!

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:59.360
Come forth, Diabound!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.900
It’s more evolved than when it fought my Gods!

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:16.910
Diabound evolved by absorbing the evil within the Millenium Items.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:20.560
Right now, I have the Millennium Ring and Millennium Puzzle!

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:24.100
Be careful, Mahad!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:27.360
Take this!  Thunder Force!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:34.160
Space-Time Afterlife!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.360
What?

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:41.810
I continued to train in the afterlife to increase my Heka’s abilities!

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.410
The pillar is falling towards the tablet!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:56.350
Diabound, protect the tablet!

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.930
That was close.

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.900
Magical Shockwave!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.770
I didn’t think he'd aim for the tablet.

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:16.460
I need it to resurrect Zorc.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.900
Zorc?

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.830
The one he talked about...

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:23.330
That’s right.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:27.250
My true power lies on the other side of this gate.

00:19:27.250 --> 00:19:30.780
I summon another Ka to protect the tablet!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.210
Skeleton Fiend!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.030
Two Kas?

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.360
Now I can defeat you without worry.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.360
I activate Diabound’s effect!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.000
Shadow Camouflage!

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.960
Don’t let it escape, Mahad!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.600
Rapid Fire Magic!

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:05.600
It’s pointless to attack randomly!

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.630
One attack will end you!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:12.990
I don’t think so.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:18.090
You missed on purpose!

00:20:18.090 --> 00:20:21.980
Your Diabound has nowhere to hide!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.850
Dark Rapid Fire Magic!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.140
Did I destroy it?

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.560
I see.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:39.770
You and your spellcaster have increased your levels.

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:44.190
But it's not enough to defeat me!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:49.960
Spirits!  Enter my body and give me power!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:56.940
The evil spirits entering my body will magnify Diabound’s power!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.280
Rapid Fire Magic!

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:07.150
What?

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:08.720
Helical Shockwave!

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:15.520
Mahad!

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:19.320
I’ll blast you into bits so you can never return to this world again!

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:20.940
Lightning Bullet!

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:28.970
Is he dead?

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:33.930
Mahad!

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:38.450
Mana?

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:42.760
Master, hang in there!

00:21:45.690 --> 00:21:47.130
Mana!

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:48.990
I made it in time!

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:17.030
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:32.750
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:38.590
Without a goal in mind

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:47.160
We just step towards our dream

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:52.800
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:52.990 --> 00:23:01.270
Your eye will find it

00:23:01.630 --> 00:23:07.080
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:15.220
Will touch your soul

00:23:15.410 --> 00:23:18.480
In a duel

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:34.650
Yugi went to Kul Elna's temple to find Bakura.

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:39.620
But the Millennium Items and the spirits have powered up his Diabound.

00:23:39.620 --> 00:23:42.130
Mahad is powerless against it.

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:46.700
That's when Mana's spirit saves them.

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:51.740
The priest arrive, starting the battle between Bakura and the priests.

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.960
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The End of Bandit King Bakura

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:56.600
Stay tuned!
